{"ref":"BDB, שִׁמְרִי","hw":"שִׁמְרִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁמְרִי</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> usually Σαμαρει, etc.:<br><strong>1.</strong>  in Simeon, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:37\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.37\">1 Ch 4:37</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  father of a hero of David <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:45\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.45\">1 Ch 11:45</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  Levites: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.10\">1 Ch 26:10</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.13\">2 Ch 29:13</a>, Ζαμβρει, Σαμβρι.","next":"BDB, שִׁמְרָת","prev":"BDB, שֹׁמֵר"}